1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,833
Three.

2
00:00:00,833 --> 00:00:10,468
Carbon dioxide, sulphur dioxide, aluminium chloride and boron trifluoride all act as acids, but contain no hydrogen to give.

3
00:00:10,468 --> 00:00:11,302
Four.

4
00:00:11,302 --> 00:00:16,315
Ammonia and sodium carbonate are bases, but have no hydroxide group.

5
00:00:16,315 --> 00:00:17,330
And five.

6
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:19,101
It ignores the solvent.

7
00:00:19,101 --> 00:00:23,528
Dry hydrogen chloride gas does not even redden dry litmus.

8
00:00:23,528 --> 00:00:26,940
The water is an active partner, not a spectator.

